 "notes": "Officers & Membership page covers the July 1, 2026 - June 30, 2027 term (term year, not a last-updated date) and lists 40 board members; officer names print in capitals there and mixed-case in the roster. Asterisked former board chairs (Moerdler, Reyes, Spalter, Wolpoff) recorded as a role. Committee chairs and the Budget/Executive rosters come from the cached committee pages; the Executive Committee page still names Julie Reyes as Chairperson with Sergio Villaverde/Margaret Della/Joy Campbell Priveterre as officers, which conflicts with the 2026-27 officers page (Della chair), so it appears to predate the July 2026 officer election and the Executive chair is left null. The regenerated cache/text/208.txt omitted the last five committee pages (economic-development, education-libraries-cultural-affairs, environment-sanitation, executive-committee, health-hospitals-social-services); their text was extracted directly from the cached HTML in cache/pages/208/. Community (public) committee members (e.g. Sharon Asherman, Ashley Medina, Judith Green, Karen Argenti, Dr. Robert Fanuzzi, Rob Spalter) are excluded from members arrays. Staff (District Manager Farrah Kule Rubin, Community Associate Jaylyn Adorno, Community Coordinator Ardhmir 'Ardy' Malziu) excluded. Housing, Land Use, Law/Rules/Ethics, Parks, Public Safety, T&T, Youth, Nominating and the three special committees have no cached roster page, so only chairs (from the Executive/Budget pages) are recorded."
